#SECRET ENVIRONMENT VARIABLE NAMES, THE ORIGINAL VALUES ARE THEIR OWN NAMES WHICH WILL BE REPLACED WITH THE SECRET VALUES ONCE OBTAINED FROM AWS SYSTEMS MANAGEMENT (SSM) PARAMETERS STORE
#THE PARAMETER NAMES IN THE NEXT SECTION "SECRET PARAMETERS NAMES" ARE THE SECRET PARAMETER NAMES AS STORED BY AMPLIFY IN THE AWS SSM
MONGO_URI_VAR=MONGO_URI
JWT_SECRET_VAR=JWT_SECRET
PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID_VAR=PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID
